      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e should we treat \u0027multiple pviommus with the same id\u0027 as error?\n\nYes, hence my suggestion of using a dictionary, as IDs must be unique.\n\n\u003e What about we just merging those pviommus?\n\nNo, if the input device is invalid, it isn\u0027t `pvmfw`\u0027s role to fix it: it should only do verification and the DT shouldn\u0027t differ between protected and non-protected, in that aspect.",
